{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.poster.avif?t=1757754691\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.webm?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.mp4?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELARIENNE: Everything Comes Down to Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ELARIENNE is a pure luck-based defense game where every summon can change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A defense game where luck shapes your army\u2014and strategy keeps you alive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit is summoned randomly\u2014from the most basic tier all the way to the ultra-rare tier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 8 tiers in total, and each unit belongs to one of three races: Humans, Elves, or Orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race has its own distinct combat traits, making team-building both exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to build your dream army? You\u2019ll need some serious luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As darkness spreads across the land, only fortune can protect the world of ELARIENNE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck in this ultimate defense challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/3f9b353cd8187be3f302c8e3d5011264.poster.avif?t=1757754691\" width=640 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/3f9b353cd8187be3f302c8e3d5011264.webm?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/3f9b353cd8187be3f302c8e3d5011264.mp4?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Runes: Luck or Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What matters more\u2014luck or strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Epic bosses to choose from three random runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune gives you another chance to shape your strategy\u2014or roll the dice again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.poster.avif?t=1757754691\" width=640 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.webm?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.mp4?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive 150 Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies appear in waves and follow a fixed looping path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t defeat them, they stay on the field and stack with future waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let 70 enemies build up on the map, or fail to kill a boss before time runs out, and your run ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When too many monsters gather, the darkness consumes ELARIENNE and the world falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the line before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.poster.avif?t=1757754691\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.webm?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.mp4?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Yet Tactical</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The units you summon shape how you choose runes and upgrades\u2014turning randomness into strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will luck be on your side? Or will you fall to the darkness?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Triumph","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/14d5f5b177e5f35d7291300e6ed3f64b42d31b6d.jpg"},{"name":"Crack in the Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/d88b4414a0ef1b08f7a85d679df565c75dcd1109.jpg"},{"name":"Path of the Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/491578bf246edf1b824be0067914d817e843a4ee.jpg"},{"name":"The First Trial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/34110c18844af66c6c69a3682c1b05850bb91bc4.jpg"},{"name":"Heir of Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/8a662b5c75276ff1bd8db10053f249f5b69b4941.jpg"},{"name":"Harbinger of Chaos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/d5642708f08206f2324c429f9062b