s to choose from three random runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune gives you another chance to shape your strategy\u2014or roll the dice again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.poster.avif?t=1757754691\" width=640 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.webm?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.mp4?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive 150 Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies appear in waves and follow a fixed looping path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t defeat them, they stay on the field and stack with future waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let 70 enemies build up on the map, or fail to kill a boss before time runs out, and your run ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When too many monsters gather, the darkness consumes ELARIENNE and the world falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the line before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.poster.avif?t=1757754691\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.webm?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.mp4?t=1757754691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Yet Tactical</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The units you summon shape how you choose runes and upgrades\u2014turning randomness into strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will luck be on your side? Or will you fall to the darkness?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["JDL"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/1628527495a5b8d6708a277615689068dea4c922/header.jpg?t=1757754691","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145220,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145220/movie480.mp4?t=1756043429","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145220/movie_max.mp4?t=1756043429"},"name":"ELARIENNE","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145220/e0be4d743056bca56b3ffa164aa77e4e5de2e62c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756043429","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145220/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756043429","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145220/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756043429"}}],"name":"ELARIENNE","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"ELARIENNE - $7.99 USD","packageid":1170316,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":799}],"title":"Buy ELARIENNE"}],"packages":[1170316],"pc_requ